AAAAA          JOB  PRAB - PRINT CAPR ABSTRACTS - NOV 18, 1964             PRAB 
AAAAB          CTL  431                                                    PRAB 
AA001*                                                                     PRAB 
AA002*  PROGRAMMERS - CARL KURTZ AND DONNA MONTGOMERY                      PRAB 
AA003*                                                                     PRAB 
AA004*  PURPOSE OF THIS PROGRAM IS TO CREATE THE CAPR                      PRAB 
AA005*    ABSTRACT OF EDPM PROGRAMS                                        PRAB 
AA006*                                                                     PRAB 
AA007*  INPUT IS MAC-CAPR MASTER FILE                                      PRAB 
AA008*                                                                     PRAB 
AA009*  OUTPUT IS THE CAPR ABSTRACT CATAL0G OF EDPM PROGRAMS PREPARED      PRAB 
AA010*    ON-LINE, OR VIA AN OFF-LINE REPORT TAPE, OR BOTH.                PRAB 
AA011*    THE REPORT TAPE DOES NOT HAVE TAPE HEADER OR TRAILER LABELS.     PRAB 
AA013*    IT MAY BE PRINTED WITH ANY STANDARD UTILITY PRINT PROGRAM        PRAB 
AA014*    WHICH WILL ACCEPT 720 PRINT CONTROLS.                            PRAB 
AA015*                                                                     PRAB 
AA016*  TAPE UNIT ASSIGNMENTS                                              PRAB 
AA017*    UNIT 2 - MAC-CAPR MASTER FILE-UPDATED                            PRAB 
AA018*    UNIT 3 - PRINT TAPE, CAPR ABSTRACT OF EDPM PROGRAMS              PRAB 
AA019*                                                                     PRAB 
AA020*  DATE CONTROL CARD SHOULD FOLLOW OBJECT DECK                        PRAB 
AA021*    COLUMNS 6-17 ARE CALENDAR DATE-FORMAT-JAN 15, 1964               PRAB 
AA022*    COLUMN 23 IS RUN TYPE, B FOR BASIC, S FOR                        PRAB 
AA023*       SUPPLEMENTAL                                                  PRAB 
AA024*    COLUMNS 24-28 ARE 5-DIGIT DATE IN FORMAT -YYDDD-                 PRAB 
AA025*       WHERE YY IS LAST 2 DIGITS OF YEAR AND DDD                     PRAB 
AA026*       IS DAY OF YEAR. THIS DATE IS USED TO DETERMINE                PRAB 
AA027*       WHETHER AN ENTRY WILL BE PROCESSED ON SUPPLEMENTAL RUNS       PRAB 
AA028*                                                                     PRAB 
AA03A*  SENSE SWITCHES                                                     PRAB 
AA03B*    IO AND A ON                                                      PRAB 
AA03C*    B ON FOR ON-LINE PRINT                                           PRAB 
AA03D*    C ON TO PREPARE PRINT TAPE.                                      PRAB 
AA03E*    ALL OTHERS OFF                                                   PRAB 
AA032*                                                                     PRAB 
AA033*  HALT LISTING AND ACTION TO BE TAKEN                                PRAB 
AA034*    A-ADDR      REASON FOR HALT AND ACTION NECESSARY                 PRAB 
AA035*                                                                     PRAB 
AA036*     520      OUT OF SEQUENCE ON MAC FILE-ABANDON JOB                PRAB 
AA037*     521      TAPE ERROR READING MAC FILE-PRESS START                PRAB 
AA038*                TO TRY 10 MORE TIMES                                 PRAB 
AA039*     525      TAPE ERROR READING HEADER OR TRAILER ON                PRAB 
AA04A*                MAC FILE-PRESS START TO TRY AGAIN                    PRAB 
AA04D*     529      END OF REEL ON MAC FILE-MOUNT NEXT                     PRAB 
AA04E*                INPUT, PRESS START                                   PRAB 
AA04H*     530      TAPE ERROR WRITING ON PRINT TAPE-PRESS                 PRAB 
AA04I*                START TO TRY 10 MORE TIMES                           PRAB 
AA04L*     531      END OF REEL ON PRINT TAPE-MOUNT SCRATCH,               PRAB 
AA04M*                PRESS START                                          PRAB 
AA04P*     600      SENSE SWITCHES B AND C ARE BOTH OFF. ONE OF THESE      PRAB 
AA04Q*               SWITCHES SHOULD BE ON TO PRODUCE SOME KIND OF         PRAB 
AA04R*               OUTPUT.                                               PRAB 
AA04S*               CORRECT SWITCH SETTING AND PRESS START.               PRAB 
AA04U*     601      INVALID INSTALLMENT CODE IN MAC RECORD-                PRAB 
AA04V*                ABANDON JOB                                          PRAB 
AA04W*     606      WRONG LENGTH RECORD ON MAC-ABANDON JOB                 PRAB 
AA04X*     607      IMPROPER CONTROL CARD. COULD BE MISSING REPORT DATE,   PRAB 
AA04Y*               TYPE OF RUN NOT SPECIFIED B OR S, NO DATE SUPPLIED    PRAB 
AA04Z*               FOR SUPPLEMENTAL RUN.                                 PRAB 
AA05A*                CORRECT CONTROL CARD, PLACE IT IN THE READ FEED      PRAB 
AA05B*                AND PRESS START.                                     PRAB 
AA05C*     621      FIRST RECORD ON MAC REEL IS NOT A                      PRAB 
AA05D*                HEADER LABEL-MOUNT CORRECT TAPE-PRESS START.         PRAB 
AA05G*     622      HEADER LABEL ON MAC HAS IMPROPER IDENTITY              PRAB 
AA05H*                MOUNT CORRECT TAPE PRESS START.                      PRAB 
AA05L*     623      HEADER LABEL ON MAC HAS INCORRECT REEL SEQUENCE        PRAB 
AA05M*                NUMBER-MOUNT CORRECT TAPE-PRESS START.               PRAB 
AA05R*     624      EOR-EOF INDICATOR ON MAC TRAILER IS                    PRAB 
AA05S*                INVALID-ABANDON JOB                                  PRAB 
AA05V*     625      BLOCK COUNT ON MAC TRAILER IS OUT OF                   PRAB 
AA05W*                BALANCE-RESTART JOB                                  PRAB 
AA06A*     692      PROGRAM OR MACHINE ERROR-TAKE DIAGNOSTIC ACTION AND    PRAB 
AA06C*                ABANDON JOB.                                         PRAB 
AA06K*     999      END OF JOB                                             PRAB 
01009          ORG  333                                                    PRAB 
01010          DCW  '⯒'       AREA DEFINING GMWM TO PROTECT CORE IN THE    PRAB 
01011*                        EVENT A LONG RECORD IS READ BY THE HEADER    PRAB 
01012*                        AND TRAILER CHECKING ROUTINES.  THE PRINT    PRAB 
01013*                        AREA IS USED BY THESE ROUTINES AS THE        PRAB 
01014*                        INPUT AREA.                                  PRAB 
